      "width": 716.24,
      "height": 237.6,
      "text": "1. deploy user + sudo        (Module 2)\n2. hardened, key-only SSH     (Module 3)\n3. Nginx + app as a service   (Modules 2-3)\n4. nightly cron backups       (Modules 4-5)\n5. journald + ops.sh monitoring (Module 5)\n6. prove it: kill the app, watch systemd heal it",
